<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/info-pages.css">

<main class="info-page privacy-page">

    <section class="priv-hero">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">
            Your privacy matters to us. Learn how KV Artchives collects,
            uses, and protects your information.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-content">

        <article class="policy-section">
            <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>
                At KV Archives, we believe in transparency regarding the data we collect. When you visit our Artisan's Gallery, create an account, or
make a purchase, we collect certain information to provide you with a curated and personalized experience.
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>Personal Information: Name, email address, billing and shipping addresses provided during checkout.</li>
                <li>Transaction Data: Details about the artisanal pieces you purchase, payment methods (processed securely via third parties), and
purchase history.</li>
                <li>Device Information: Browser type, IP address, and interaction data to ensure our digital gallery displays beautifully on your
device.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="policy-section">
            <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>

            <p>
                The information we collect is utilized with the same care as our handmade ceramics. We use it to:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>Fulfill and manage your orders, ensuring secure delivery of your chosen pieces.</li>
                <li>Communicate with you regarding order updates, customer support inquiries, and gallery news (only if you opt-in).</li>
                <li>Enhance and personalize your browsing experience within our digital space.</li>
                <li>Maintain the security and integrity of our platform.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="policy-section">
            <h2>3. How We Protect Information</h2>

            <p>
                We treat your personal data with the utmost respect. We implement industry-standard security measures, including encryption and
secure server hosting, to protect your information against unauthorized access, alteration, or destruction. However, please
remember that no method of transmission over the Internet is entirely secure, though we strive to use commercially acceptable
means to protect your personal information.
            </p>
        </article>

        <article class="policy-section">
            <h2>4. Sharing of Information</h2>

            <p>
                We do not sell your personal information to third parties. We only share your data with trusted service providers who assist us in
operating our website, conducting our business, or servicing you, so long as those parties agree to keep this information
confidential.
            </p>
        </article>

        <article class="policy-section">
            <h2>5. Cookies and Website Data</h2>

            <p>
                Our website uses cookies to enhance your browsing experience. Cookies are small files that a site or its service provider transfers to
your computer's hard drive through your Web browser that enables the site's systems to recognize your browser and capture and
remember certain information.
            </p>
        </article>

        <article class="policy-section">
            <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>

            <p>
                You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal information. You may also object to the processing of your data or
request that we restrict the processing of your information. To exercise these rights, please contact us using the information
provided below.
            </p>
        </article>

    </section>

    <section class="policy-contact">
        <div class="message-icon">✉</div>

        <h2>Privacy Questions?</h2>

        <p>
            If you have any questions or concerns regarding our
Privacy Policy or the handling of your data, please don't
hesitate to reach out to our dedicated support team.
        </p>

        <a href="/contact" class="primary-button">
            Contact Us
        </a>
    </section>

</main>